        {
          "text": "Munyo jowinjo Paulo luwo kwoŋ cerino pa jom'otho, megi kwoŋ jo jonyero ayin, to joman jowaco ni, “Wamito iluwi kwoŋ gime kendo.” ",
          "type": "text",
