        {
          "text": "Cwo moro joluwo go to jolokere jom'oyeyo; kwoŋ jo oyido obedo Dionisio, acel kwoŋ jokweth ma Arewopago, dhako m'ilwoŋo ni Damaris, kodi joman.",
